{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","太一与亚古兽"],["/description_i18n/cn","太一是拥有优秀的领导力和行动力的小学五年级学生，持有勇气徽章。亚古兽是他的搭档数码宝贝，总是充满活力。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","行くぞアグモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/jp","行くぞ、アグモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"行くぞ、アグモン！","text":"上吧，亚古兽！","target_transcript":"行くぞアグモン！","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/jp","アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。","text":"亚古兽变得更强了。","target_transcript":"アグモンがもっと強くなったぞ。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","アグモンワープ進化！ウォーグレイモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/jp","アグモンワープ進化！ウォーグレイモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"アグモンワープ進化！ウォーグレイモン！","text":"亚古兽跃迁进化！战斗暴龙兽！","target_transcript":"アグモンワープ進化！ウォーグレイモン！","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/cn","うわ、グレイモン。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/jp","うわ、グレイモン。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"うわ、グレイモン。","text":"啊，暴龙兽……","target_transcript":"うわ、グレイモン。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/cn","よーしやったぞー！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/jp","よーしやったぞー！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"よーしやったぞー！","text":"好，成功了！","target_transcript":"よーしやったぞー！","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/cn","俺とアグモンがみんなを守る。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/jp","俺とアグモンがみんなを守る。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"俺とアグモンがみんなを守る。","text":"我和亚古兽会保护大家。","target_transcript":"俺とアグモンがみんなを守る。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","どうだうまいかアグモン。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/jp","どうだ、うまいか、アグモン？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"どうだ、うまいか、アグモン？","text":"怎么样，好吃吗，亚古兽？","target_transcript":"どうだうまいかアグモン。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","俺が描いたアグモンだ。どうだ、そっくりだろ。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/jp","俺が描いたアグモンだ。どうだ、そっくりだろ。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"俺が描いたアグモンだ。どうだ、そっくりだろ。","text":"这是我画的亚古兽。怎么样，画得很像吧？","target_transcript":"俺が描いたアグモンだ。どうだ、そっくりだろ。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我喜欢这个，谢谢！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","太一非常擅长踢足球，是御台场小学的王牌射手。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","太一对画画不太在行。他曾经为辨识方向画过一幅法易路岛的地图，可惜除了他本人外谁都看不懂。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","太一的行动力很强，但并非只是莽撞行事。他能够细致地观察周围情况，从而做出正确的决断。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","在冒险途中，太一曾向大和讨教厨艺，学会了更好吃的蛋包饭烹饪方法。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","太一随身携带着一副单筒望远镜，在冒险途中用于侦察地形、敌情，起到了重要的用处。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","亚古兽非常贪吃，常常一会儿就肚子饿了。饥饿时，甚至一口气吞下过一整条鱼。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","太一曾经因为过于焦躁想让亚古兽进化，导致亚古兽错误地进化为了丧尸暴龙兽。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","亚古兽有时也会展现出有些胆小的一面，例如夜晚去洗手间时，曾让太一陪同过。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","太一充满勇气。曾经他为了拯救同伴，即使面对流有危险高压电的墙壁，也没有屈服于恐惧。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","当太一发现亚古兽的优点时，他总是会毫不吝啬地给予亚古兽称赞。"]]}